 "lines": {"rubber_duck_wipe_the_belly": ["Belly's wiped. It's still a belly. I still did it.", "Rubber shines. Smug rubber, now."], "rubber_duck_buff_the_bill": ["Bill's gleaming. I could see me in it, if I looked.", "Chest feathers: the only cloth I own."], "rubber_duck_mend_the_scuffed_base": ["Rubbed it smooth. Good as scuffed. Better, nearly.", "Fixed my own damage. Growth, I think."], "rubber_duck_knock_the_snow_cap_off": ["Snow off the head. It looks relieved, as much as rubber can.", "Hat's gone. Duck's still dumber than it looks."], "rubber_duck_brace_against_the_flank_in_the_gale": ["Gust shoved the duck, I shoved back. Rubber one, wind nil.", "Stood my ground. The duck stood its base."], "rubber_duck_squeeze_the_belly": ["Squeak. Honest noise. Better than most things I say.", "One note, and it sticks to it."], "rubber_duck_play_the_duck_like_an_organ": ["Two ducks, one duck. Four squeaks, no melody. Our best work.", "Jazz, if jazz was a rubber bath toy."], "rubber_duck_boop_the_bill_tip": ["Booped it. It didn't boop back. It never does. Coward.", "Bill to bill. Short on conversation."], "rubber_duck_sumo_bump": ["Sumo rules: bump, back up, bump. It lost on points.", "Belly to belly. Mine's the squishier opinion."], "rubber_duck_peer_into_the_painted_eye": ["It never blinked. Painted open. Cheating.", "Won on a technicality. The technicality's rubber."], "rubber_duck_taste_the_rubber": ["Rubber, bleach, someone's childhood, boiled.", "Smells like a bathroom. Not mine. I use the pond."], "rubber_duck_knock_on_the_belly": ["Hollow in there. Echoes. Reminds me of me.", "Something rattles. Something always rattles."], "rubber_duck_hug_the_duck": ["I'm the real one. I tire and have opinions.", "It squeaked at me. First one to disagree in a week."], "rubber_duck_sulk_at_the_tail": ["Duck's got a smile painted on. Must be nice to be told.", "Sat with the quiet end. Quiet gets me."], "rubber_duck_warm_against_the_sunny_back": ["Warm rubber. Better than a bed. Smells like one, too.", "Thawing against a duck. Tell no one."], "rubber_duck_sing_along_with_the_squeak": ["That was a lot of squeak. I now hear in ducks.", "My ears are ringing in rubber."], "rubber_duck_shout_into_the_painted_eye": ["Told the eye off. It didn't flinch. Painted on, like my patience.", "Someone's got to say it."], "rubber_duck_argue_with_the_duck": ["Too round, too yellow, too confident. Four stars.", "Excellent bill, dreadful tail. Critics will talk."], "rubber_duck_drum_on_the_belly": ["Rain on a rubber head. A drum with a punchline.", "Sounds like thinking. Mine, usually."], "rubber_duck_shake_the_neck_and_wear_the_snow": ["Shook the neck. All the snow, one duck. Efficient.", "Snow hat, fitted. Colder than advertised."], "rubber_duck_strut_in_front_of_the_duck": ["Strutted past. The duck didn't look. It can't. I still won.", "Better posture, better bill, worse squeak. Even trade."], "rubber_duck_kick_the_base_in_a_huff": ["Kicked a duck's feet. They're rubber. Mine aren't.", "Toe says rubber hits back."], "rubber_duck_shoved_it_and_took_the_swing_back": ["Clocked from behind by a bath toy. Telling no one.", "It had a head start and a heavy bottom. Unfair."]},
